  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Inaataasate te Kadesh",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore iltung'ana le Israel, ina umata pooki, nepuonu ina ong'ata e Sin, to lapa le dukuya, netoni lelo tung'ana te Kadesh; neye Miriam te ine, nenukari ninye te ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nemetii apa enkare naok ina umata; neiturrurro ninche maate aarare Musa nearare Aron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neishankarrare lelo tung'ana Musa, nejoki, “Enaikash apa tenaa eikituata ina kata apa pee eye ilalashera lang te dukuya Olaitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kainyoo iyie pee iyaua ena umata o Laitoriani atua ena ongata, pee kipuonu aaye tene, iyiook o nkishu ang. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kainyoo pee ilepunye iyiook aitupuku te Misiri, ayau iyiook ene wueji torrono? Mme ewueji ene e nkurma, aashu ilng'abolo aashu isabibu aashu ilng'anayio ooji kukumanka; nemetii enkare naoki.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelo Musa o Aron aaing'uaa ine netii eumata aapuo kutukaji eilo ng'obor le ntumo, nebatata too nkomomi enye. Neliooyu enkitoo o Laitoriani te ninche, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nejoki Olaitoriani Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iwa ina ng'udi, nilo aiturrur ina umata, iyie o Aron ilo alashe lino, nijoki ina dapidapoi te dukuya nkonyek enye meishoru enkare; neaku iyau iyie enkare naing'uaa atua endapidapoi te nkaraki ninche; nincho metooko ina umata o nkishu enye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neya Musa ina ng'udi te dukuya Olaitoriani, anaa enaitanapa Olaitoriani ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neiturrur Musa o Aron ina umata te nebo te dukuya ina dapidapoi nejoki ninche, “Entoning taata, intae iloogolongu; Aikiyaki iyiook intae enkare naing'uaa ena dapidapoi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neilepie Musa enkaina enye aosh ina dapidapoi te ina ng'udi enye katitin are; nerukunye enkare te nkumoi, neok ina umata, o nkishu enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Olaitoriani Musa o Aron, “Ore enkaraki neitu intae kirukuruku nanu, pee kintisinyinyi nanu too nkonyek e kulo tung'ana le Israel, miyauu naa ena umata aaitijing atua ina kop naishoo ninche.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkariak e Meriba kuna, naa te ine eishankarrare iltung'ana le Israel Olaitoriani, neitodolu ninye esinyatisho enye te ninche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etomitikio Olaiguanani le Edom Israel eneeim",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eirriwayie apa Musa ilkiliku te Kadesh meshomo enetii olaiguanani le Edom, nejoki, “Nji ejo olalashe linyi Israel: iyiolo iyie enyamali pooki nikinoto iyiook: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ena kata apa pee epuo loo papa Misiri nikibik iyiook te Misiri enkata naado; ore lelo le Misiri neitaas iyiook entorroni o loo papa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore ake pee kinchiraki Olaitoriani, nening ninye oltoilo lang, neirriwaki iyiook olmalaika oilepunye iyiook aitupuku te Misiri, naa noolo iyiook ootii Kadesh, enkanasa natii olpolosie le nkop ino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nchoo naa taata iyiook maima atua enkop ino. Mikiimaa iyiook inkurman aashu ilokerin loo sabibu, nimikiok enkare to lchorro; enkoitoi nalala o laiguanani kiim. Mikimbelekenya iyiook aaim enkalo e tatene aashu enkalo e kedienye, o metaba anaa nikimpang ti atua enkop ino.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake etiaka apa Edom ninye, “Miim iyie enkop ai, maalotu ake aarare to lalem.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki iltung'ana le Israel ninye, “Eikipuo iyiook aaim enkoitoi nalala; naa ti nikiok iyiook enkare ino, nanu o nkishu aainei, nalak nanu; nchooki ake duoo maimai too nkejek, metii ae toki.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake etejo apa ninye, “Mipuopuo intae aaim.” Nelotu Edom aarare ninche eeta iltung'ana kumok, o enjore nagol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku etanya apa Edom eisho Isirael enkoitoi naaim te nkop enye, nerrinyo Isiraeli aaing'uaa ninye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Keeya e Aron",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepuo ninche aaing'uaa Kadesh, ore lelo tung'ana le Israel ina umata pooki, nepuonu oldoinyo le Hor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Olaitoriani Musa o Aron to ldoinyo le Hor, to lpolosie le nkop e Edom, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kelo Aron eneiturrurrore iltung'ana lenyena apa ootuata; amu mejing ninye atua ina kop naishoo nanu iltung'ana le Israel, amu etogolong'aka apa enkitanapata ai too nkariak e Meriba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwa Aron o Eliesa olayioni lenye niyau ninche enchumata oldoinyo le Hor; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nioru Aron ikilani lenyena ninchopoki Eliesa olayioni lenye; nelo Aron eneiturrurrokino iltung'ana lenyena, naa keye ninye te ine.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neas Musa anaa enaitanapa Olaitoriani, neilep ninche aapuo enchumata oldoinyo le Hor eing'orita ina umata pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.29.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ena 29.29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.33.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enki 33.38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.10.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 10.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neitayu Musa lelo kilani le Aron, neishopoki Eliesa olayioni lenye; neye Aron te ine te nchumata o ldoinyo. Neitoki Musa o Eliesa aadou te ilo doinyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
